---
title: Register, log in, log out (requirements 1–2)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant V as validateRegister / validateLogin
    participant C as controllers/auth
    participant UM as User model
    participant DB as MongoDB

    U->>V: POST /auth/register {name, tel, email, password}
    alt missing field, bad email / tel, password under 8 chars
        V-->>U: 400 Bad Request
    end
    V->>C: register()
    C->>UM: create({name, tel, email, password, role: user})
    UM->>DB: insert (password hashed with bcrypt)
    alt email already used
        C-->>U: 400 Duplicate email
    end
    C-->>U: 201 + HttpOnly cookies (access + refresh token)

    U->>V: POST /auth/login {email, password}
    V->>C: login()
    C->>UM: findOne({email}) + bcrypt.compare
    alt wrong email or password
        C-->>U: 401 Invalid credentials
    end
    C-->>U: 200 {role} + HttpOnly cookies

    U->>C: POST /auth/logout
    C->>DB: revoke refresh token
    C-->>U: 200 + clear cookies
